 'B',
 $q$CO reduces the iron(III) oxide: Fe₂O₃ + 3CO → 2Fe + 3CO₂. Limestone is there to remove sand as slag; it never reduces the ore.$q$,
 'single', null, 2),
('chemistry','metals-nonmetals',2021,2, $q$The oxide chiefly responsible for acid rain from industrial emissions is$q$,
