 'B',
 $q$n-pentane, 2-methylbutane and 2,2-dimethylpropane — three in total. Draw each skeleton before counting; duplicates are easy to make on paper.$q$,
 'single', null, 2),
('chemistry','organic',2022,3, $q$Poly(ethene) is formed from ethene molecules by$q$,
