 $q$The C=C double bond opens and the monomers join end to end with nothing lost — addition polymerisation. Condensation would expel a small molecule such as water (as in nylon).$q$,
 'single', null, 1),
('chemistry','organic',2024,1, $q$Controlled oxidation of ethanol with acidified potassium tetraoxodichromate(VI) gives$q$,
