('chemistry','separation',2025,2, $q$The components of crude oil are separated industrially by$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"fractional distillation"},{"label":"B","text":"simple distillation"},{"label":"C","text":"chromatography"},{"label":"D","text":"sublimation"}]$o$,
 'A',
