('biology','genetics',2021,1, $q$Two heterozygous tall pea plants (Tt × Tt) are crossed. Determine the Gametes produced, build the crosses, and state the expected phenotype ratio of tall to short offspring.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"1 tall : 1 short"},{"label":"B","text":"3 tall : 1 short"},{"label":"C","text":"2 tall : 2 short"},{"label":"D","text":"all tall"}]$o$,
