('biology','ecology',2024,1, $q$Excessive discharge of fertiliser into a lake can kill fish eventually because it$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"directly poisons the fish"},{"label":"B","text":"causes algal blooms whose eventual decay removes dissolved oxygen"},{"label":"C","text":"raises the lake temperature permanently"},{"label":"D","text":"increases light penetration"}]$o$,
