('biology','cell-structure',2024,2, $q$The movement of water molecules across a semi-permeable membrane from a dilute to a more concentrated solution is called$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"diffusion"},{"label":"B","text":"osmosis"},{"label":"C","text":"active transport"},{"label":"D","text":"transpiration"}]$o$,
