 $q$Tayo Ajayi and Vanessa Richardson meet in 1960s Oxford; the novel's spine is their relationship across England and independent Nigeria. (verified lineage)$q$,
 'single', null, 2),
('english','novel',2018,9, $q$The main action of 'In Dependence' swings chiefly between Nigeria and$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"Ghana"},{"label":"B","text":"England"},{"label":"C","text":"the United States"},{"label":"D","text":"South Africa"}]$o$,
