('english','lexis-structure',2003,31, $q$Choose the option that best explains the information conveyed in the sentence: After years of litigation, the two families agreed to bury the hatchet.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"They bought new cutlasses."},{"label":"B","text":"They resumed the litigation."},{"label":"C","text":"They made peace at last."},{"label":"D","text":"They hid weapons on the farm."}]$o$,
