 'single', null, 1),
('english','comprehension',2004,18, $q$Choose the option that best completes the gap: We could not enter the hall ___ the crowd was too dense.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"since"},{"label":"B","text":"yet"},{"label":"C","text":"lest"},{"label":"D","text":"otherwise"}]$o$,
 'A',
 $q$The dense crowd is the reason for not entering, and 'since' introduces a reason here; the other connectors introduce contrast, purpose or an alternative situation.$q$,
