('english','oral-forms',2004,20, $q$Choose the question that the following sentence, with emphatic stress on the word in capital letters, answers: John killed the SNAKE.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"Did John capture the snake?"},{"label":"B","text":"Did Ada kill the snake?"},{"label":"C","text":"Did John fear the snake?"},{"label":"D","text":"Did John kill the rat?"}]$o$,
