('english','antonyms-synonyms',2004,31, $q$Choose the option nearest in meaning to the word in quotation marks: The stalwarts gave an "ardent" welcome to the visitor. $q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"indifferent"},{"label":"B","text":"fervent"},{"label":"C","text":"reluctant"},{"label":"D","text":"careless"}]$o$,
