('english','oral-forms',2007,20, $q$Choose the question that the following sentence, with emphatic stress on the word in capital letters, answers: The dog chased the CAT.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"Did the cat chase the dog?"},{"label":"B","text":"Did the dog catch the cat?"},{"label":"C","text":"Did the dog hurt the cat?"},{"label":"D","text":"Did the dog chase the rat?"}]$o$,
