('physics','kinematics',2020,12, $q$A ball rolls off the edge of a horizontal table 1.8 m high with a speed of 3.0 m/s. Its horizontal range on the floor is (g = 10 m/s²)$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"1.8 m"},{"label":"B","text":"0.6 m"},{"label":"C","text":"3.6 m"},{"label":"D","text":"0.9 m"}]$o$,
