 2),
('physics','kinematics',2020,13, $q$A bus moving at 10 m/s accelerates uniformly at 2 m/s² until it reaches 20 m/s. The distance covered during the acceleration is$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"50 m"},{"label":"B","text":"60 m"},{"label":"C","text":"75 m"},{"label":"D","text":"100 m"}]$o$,
