 $q$v² = u² + 2as gives 400 - 100 = 2 × 2 × s, so s = 75 m. Option D treats the final speed as if the bus had started from rest.$q$,
 'single', null, 2),
('physics','dynamics',2020,14, $q$A 0.2 kg ball strikes a wall at 10 m/s head-on and rebounds at 6 m/s. The impulse the ball receives from the wall is$q$,
