('biology','cellular-processes',2012,30, $q$Anaerobic respiration in the muscles of a sprinter builds up a substance that makes the muscles tired. This substance is$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"lactic acid"},{"label":"B","text":"ethanol"},{"label":"C","text":"carbon dioxide"},{"label":"D","text":"glycogen"}]$o$,
 'A',
