('mathematics','statistics',2014,23, $q$Out of 80 candidates, 45 read the Daily Times and 38 read the Tribune. If 17 read neither paper, how many read both?$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"12"},{"label":"B","text":"25"},{"label":"C","text":"20"},{"label":"D","text":"17"}]$o$,
