('mathematics','geometry',2017,31, $q$A committee of 2 men and 3 women is to be formed from 5 men and 7 women. In how many ways can this be done?$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"70"},{"label":"B","text":"175"},{"label":"C","text":"210"},{"label":"D","text":"350"}]$o$,
