 'multi', $st$[{"title":"Find the mean","kind":"math","content":"mean = (1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5)/5 = 3","note":"The sum of the data is 15."},{"title":"Sum the squared deviations","kind":"math","content":"(−2)² + (−1)² + 0² + 1² + 2² = 4 + 1 + 0 + 1 + 4 = 10","note":"Deviations are taken from 3."},{"title":"Take the square root","kind":"math","content":"variance = 10/5 = 2, so SD = √2 ≈ 1.41","note":"Standard deviation is the root of the mean squared deviation."}]$st$, 2),
('mathematics','statistics',2018,32, $q$In 20 football matches, a team scored 0 goals in 2 matches, 1 goal in 4 matches, 2 goals in 8 matches, 3 goals in 4 matches and 4 goals in 2 matches. Find the mean number of goals scored per match.$q$,
