 'multi', $st$[{"title":"Use T₄ = S₄ − S₃","kind":"text","content":"The 4th term is the sum of the first four terms minus the sum of the first three.","note":"Cumulative sums differ by a single term."},{"title":"Evaluate both sums","kind":"math","content":"S₄ = 2(16) + 3(4) = 44 and S₃ = 2(9) + 3(3) = 27","note":"Substitute n = 4 and n = 3."},{"title":"Subtract","kind":"math","content":"T₄ = 44 − 27 = 17","note":"The difference is the 4th term."}]$st$, 2),
('mathematics','progressions',2019,18, $q$In an arithmetic progression the 4th term is 11 and the 9th term is 26. Find the 15th term.$q$,
