('mathematics','statistics',2020,32, $q$The wages of 20 workers in a factory are: ₦100 (2 workers), ₦200 (3 workers), ₦300 (5 workers), ₦400 (4 workers) and ₦500 (6 workers). Find the mean wage of the workers.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"₦305"},{"label":"B","text":"₦335"},{"label":"C","text":"₦355"},{"label":"D","text":"₦345"}]$o$,
 'D',
 $q$The total wages are (100 × 2) + (200 × 3) + (300 × 5) + (400 × 4) + (500 × 6) = ₦6,900. The mean is 6900/20 = ₦345.$q$,
 'multi', $st$[{"title":"Multiply each wage by its frequency","kind":"math","content":"100 × 2 + 200 × 3 + 300 × 5 + 400 × 4 + 500 × 6 = 200 + 600 + 1500 + 1600 + 3000 = ₦6,900","note":"This is the combined wages of all 20 workers."},{"title":"Confirm the number of workers","kind":"text","content":"2 + 3 + 5 + 4 + 6 = 20 workers.","note":"The frequencies must total 20."},{"title":"Divide the total by the count","kind":"math","content":"Mean wage = 6900/20 = ₦345","note":"Mean equals total wages divided by the number of workers."}]$st$, 2),
