('mathematics','calculus',2021,28, $q$A particle moves along a line so that its displacement s in metres after t seconds is s = t³ − 6t² + 9t. Find its acceleration at t = 3 s.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"6 m/s²"},{"label":"B","text":"3 m/s²"},{"label":"C","text":"9 m/s²"},{"label":"D","text":"24 m/s²"}]$o$,
