 'single', null, 2),
('mathematics','number-surds',2024,12, $q$Express 2√12 in the form √k, and hence find the value of k.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"48"},{"label":"B","text":"24"},{"label":"C","text":"12"},{"label":"D","text":"144"}]$o$,
