 $q$Divide each term by √2: √6/√2 = √3 and √2/√2 = 1, so the expression is √3 − 1.$q$,
 'single', null, 2),
('mathematics','indices-logs',2025,13, $q$Simplify (x⁻³)^(2/3).$q$,
