('mathematics','indices-logs',2025,15, $q$Evaluate log₄ 2 + log₄ 8.$q$,
 $o$[{"label":"A","text":"3"},{"label":"B","text":"4"},{"label":"C","text":"2"},{"label":"D","text":"16"}]$o$,
